---
import { archive } from '../data/site';

// Until the maps move here, the drawer points to the archived site's posts
---

<div class="linkout">
	<p><strong>The map drawer opens as the maps move to this site.</strong> Until then, maps from earlier posts are on the archived site.</p>
	<div class="ctas"><a class="btn" href={`${archive.href}blog/`}>Browse the archive <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</div>
